<h1 data-copy-en="Orchid" data-copy-zh="Orchid">Orchid</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Follow changing shifts, personal visits and Reclamation Bay services." data-copy-zh="跟随班次变化，推进个人事件与再生工坊服务。">Follow changing shifts, personal visits and Reclamation Bay services.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Rebalance_Salvage"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Salvage_Grades.2C_Scraps_and_Pristine_Cores"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Salvage_Grades,_Scraps_and_Pristine_Cores"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Reclamation_Intake_and_Daily_Processing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Exact_best_scene_and_date_answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Borrowed_Yesterdays_and_Under_Glass"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Practical_Purpose"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Named_for_Something_Beautiful"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="What_Survives"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_ordinary_answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Seven_Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Talk_and_Flowers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Orchid — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/orchid.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Orchid — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/orchid.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Orchid — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Orchid’s personal route opens the Reclamation Bay and continues through three conversations and two optional dates. Her recycling queue and workshops are separate services with their own resource costs.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_Orchid_.E2.80.94_Her_Changing_Schedule"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_Orchid_—_Her_Changing_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Before Room to Reclaim, find her at Surplus Distribution Center, 12:00–17:59 daily. After that scene, her home is Reclamation Bay, 06:00–23:59. After First Intake, every third day she returns to Surplus at 12:00–17:59 and is absent from the Bay during that shift. She sleeps 00:00–05:59.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Main_Story_Encounters_with_Orchid"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Route_in_Order"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>After Story 34 and Acquaintance (50), visit Surplus 12:00–17:59 for The Overflow; then Engineering 08:00–21:59 for Room to Reclaim; then the Bay 08:00–19:59 for First Intake.</p><p>Alternate the later scenes and conversations: What Survives → Keep One → Named for Something Beautiful → Useful Until Empty → No Assigned Value → No Practical Purpose → Something New. Neither date is required by this scene chain.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Overflow</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Surplus Distribution Center; 12:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after Story 34</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Room to Reclaim</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Engineering; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after The Overflow</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">First Intake</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Reclamation Bay; 08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after Room to Reclaim</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Keep One</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Reclamation Bay; 08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after First Intake / What Survives</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Useful Until Empty</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Reclamation Bay; 18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Keep One / Named for Something Beautiful</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Assigned Value</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Reclamation Bay; 08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Useful Until Empty</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Something New</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Reclamation Bay; 18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after No Assigned Value / No Practical Purpose</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">What Survives</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; Friend (100); after First Intake</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">75 min; 15 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Named for Something Beautiful</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; Close Friend (200); after Keep One / What Survives</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Practical Purpose</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; Crush (400); after No Assigned Value / Named for Something Beautiful</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; restores 15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The two dates start 10:00–17:59 from the Bay and require their preceding conversation. Every third day, her Surplus shift leaves 10:00–11:59 as the usable daytime start window.</p><p>Something Worth Keeping requires 10 Resistance Clout and Orchid acquired in the Army; she is in the default Army roster. At the Bay it takes 0 minutes, does not spend Clout and grants Rally Patch once.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie_.E2.80.94_Separate_Levels.2C_Gifts_and_Equipment_Reward"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kupie_—_Separate_Levels,_Gifts_and_Equipment_Reward"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Orchid</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Flowers</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+3 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Process Reclamation Queue</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; after First Intake</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Borrowed Yesterdays</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; Friend (100); after First Intake / What Survives; 10:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $90; 25 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Under Glass</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; Close Friend (200); after Keep One / Named for Something Beautiful; 10:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $120; 25 Energy; restores 15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rebalance Salvage</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; after First Intake</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Surplus Distribution Center; during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Something Worth Keeping</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; Resistance Clout 10; Army member acquired</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">receive Rally Patch; once, Clout not spent</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Barrier Workshop</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Reclamation Bay; during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">open the workshop; purchase costs inside</td></tr></tbody></table><p>After First Intake, queue surplus through the Bay console, then select Process Reclamation Queue while Orchid is present. Processing takes 60 minutes, once per day; its affection and recovered materials depend on the batch. Depositing alone does not process it.</p><p>Rebalance Salvage takes 0 minutes and charges 2–10 random units from the four specialist salvage resources, then redistributes the remainder. It leaves ordinary Scraps and Pristine Cores unchanged. Her Barrier Workshop opens permanent structural research; the Reclamation and Workshops guides give recipes and costs.</p><p>Flowers are a Bay-only gift: one item, 10 minutes, 3 base affection, three times per day.</p><p>Favorite stats are Perception, Technology, Ability. The learned Appraisal skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Completion_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If absent from the Bay at noon, check whether the day number is divisible by three and visit Surplus.</li><li>The queue action needs a processable queue, First Intake and her actual presence; its daily use is shared across the day.</li><li>For dates on every third day, start before noon rather than waiting in the Bay during her other shift.</li><li>The 18:00–19:59 automatic scenes use a narrow evening window. Return then after meeting the preceding scene and conversation requirements.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-reclamation-bay.html">Queue processing and recipes</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-workshops.html">Barrier Workshop</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Army gifts</a></li><li><a href="character-epom.html">EPOM</a></li><li><a href="character-jinx.html">Jinx</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Rebalance_Salvage"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Salvage_Grades.2C_Scraps_and_Pristine_Cores"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Salvage_Grades,_Scraps_and_Pristine_Cores"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Reclamation_Intake_and_Daily_Processing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Exact_best_scene_and_date_answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Borrowed_Yesterdays_and_Under_Glass"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Practical_Purpose"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Named_for_Something_Beautiful"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-What_Survives"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_ordinary_answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Seven_Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Talk_and_Flowers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Orchid 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/orchid.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Orchid 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/orchid.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Orchid 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Orchid的个人路线会开放再生工坊，之后还有三次交心对话与两次可选约会。回收队列与工坊是独立服务，各有资源消耗。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_Orchid_.E2.80.94_Her_Changing_Schedule"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_Orchid_—_Her_Changing_Schedule"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>留给再生的空间之前，每天12:00—17:59在剩余物资分配中心。完成后改到再生工坊，06:00—23:59出现。首批入库之后，每逢第3的倍数日，她12:00—17:59返回剩余物资分配中心，这段时间不在再生工坊；00:00—05:59休息。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Main_Story_Encounters_with_Orchid"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Route_in_Order"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>主线34后达到相识（50），12:00—17:59到剩余物资分配中心进行满溢，再于08:00—21:59到工程室进行留给再生的空间，最后08:00—19:59到再生工坊进行首批入库。</p><p>后续交替进行：幸存之物 → 留下一件 → 因美好之物得名 → 用到枯竭 → 未定价值 → 毫无实用目的 → 崭新的事物。两次约会都不是这条事件链的必经步骤。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">满溢</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">剩余物资分配中心；12:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：主线34</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">留给再生的空间</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">工程室；08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：满溢</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">首批入库</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">再生工坊；08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：留给再生的空间</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">留下一件</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">再生工坊；08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：首批入库、幸存之物</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">用到枯竭</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">再生工坊；18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：留下一件、因美好之物得名</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未定价值</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">再生工坊；08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：用到枯竭</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">崭新的事物</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">再生工坊；18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）；完成：未定价值、毫无实用目的</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">幸存之物</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；朋友（100）；完成：首批入库</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">75分钟；15精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">因美好之物得名</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；亲密朋友（200）；完成：留下一件、幸存之物</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">毫无实用目的</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；迷恋（400）；完成：未定价值、因美好之物得名</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；恢复15镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>两次约会均从再生工坊10:00—17:59开始，要求前一次交心对话。第3的倍数日中午有另一班次，因此当天可用的白天开始时段为10:00—11:59。</p><p>值得珍藏的东西要求反抗军声望10和Orchid已加入军团；她属于默认军团成员。在再生工坊进行，不消耗时间或声望，一次性给予重整徽章。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie_.E2.80.94_Separate_Levels.2C_Gifts_and_Equipment_Reward"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kupie_—_Separate_Levels,_Gifts_and_Equipment_Reward"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Orchid交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天4次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送花</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；鲜花×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+3；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">处理回收队列</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；完成：首批入库</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">借来的昨日</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；朋友（100）；完成：首批入库、幸存之物；10:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$90；25精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">玻璃之下</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；亲密朋友（200）；完成：留下一件、因美好之物得名；10:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$120；25精力；恢复15镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">均衡回收资源</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；完成：首批入库</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">剩余物资分配中心；头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天4次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">值得珍藏的东西</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；反抗军声望10；已加入军团</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">获得重整徽章；仅一次，不消耗声望</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">屏障工坊</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">再生工坊；头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">打开工坊；内部购买另付资源</td></tr></tbody></table><p>首批入库后，先用再生工坊控制台投入物品，再在Orchid出现时选择处理回收队列。每次60分钟，每天一次，好感与产出按本批物品结算；只投入物品不会自动处理。</p><p>均衡回收资源不消耗时间，从四种专用回收资源中随机扣除2—10份，再重新分配余下资源，普通废料与纯净核心不变。屏障工坊可购买永久建筑研究，配方与费用见再生工坊和工坊指南。</p><p>送花只在再生工坊可用，每次消耗一份鲜花、10分钟，给予3基础好感，每天三次。</p><p>偏好的属性为感知、科技、能力。学会鉴定可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Completion_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>中午再生工坊没人时，检查日期是否为3的倍数，再到剩余物资分配中心找她。</li><li>处理队列需首批入库、可处理的队列和她实际在场，每日次数共用。</li><li>第3的倍数日约会请在中午前开始，不必在她另一个班次时等再生工坊头像。</li><li>18:00—19:59的自动事件时段很短，满足前置事件与对话后需在该时段返回。</li></ul></section>
